  "title": "New Bags | Balenciaga Debuts Winter 26 Ski Collection Le City Bag: Shearling Trim in Bubblegum Pink",
  "original_title": "新包 | Balenciaga 上市冬季26滑雪系列 Le City 机车包：羊毛滚边，泡泡糖粉色",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga's Winter 26 skiwear bags feature Le City styles: a beige shearling backpack with caramel goatskin and a bubblegum pink top-handle bag with sheepskin trim and bow charm.",
