      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This week, Balenciaga unveils its Winter 26 Skiwear bag collection, headlined by the Le City motorcycle-bag family. The backpack gets a fresh makeover in beige shearling, accented with caramel-brown goatskin details — a beige-and-brown pairing that radiates cozy winter warmth. The top-handle bag is drenched head to toe in sweet bubblegum pink, with creamy sheepskin trim as its standout feature and a bow charm for a retro sweetheart feel.",
