      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The sweetest, most adorable piece in this season's lineup is undoubtedly this Le City small motorcycle bag, crafted from soft, supple suede lambskin. Its edges are finished with fluffy shearling trim that feels as comforting and soothing as a little princess's pillow. The real highlight is the all-over light bubblegum pink, with a charming bow tie at the center of the opening and light brown textured lambskin details for a dainty, lovable character.",
